        "r": 560.4840000000003,
        "b": 585.4983344167462
      },
      "content": "See section 6.13 for convection fan motor assembly removal to access the catalytic converters.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1782",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
