      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 444.54601953125,
        "r": 301.977,
        "b": 423.6153344167462
      },
      "content": "The lower catalyst, is again fitted using two M7 hex flange nuts, tightened to 2.1 Nm.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1782",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
